<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net sellers of Japanese stocks in week.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of Japanese stocks on the Tokyo, Osaka and Nagoya stock exchanges in the week of December 24 to December 27, exchange data showed.</p>
<p>Foreign investors turned to net sellers after having bought for six weeks.</p>
<p>The figures, which are rounded, are as follows:</p>
<p>    Total foreign buying	   214.16 billion yen</p>
<p>    Total foreign selling	  232.37 billion yen</p>
<p>    Net selling			 18.21 billion yen</p>
<p>    Previous week net buying	 4.63 billion yen</p>
